==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] (400%) spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] spawns after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>.
*1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] spawns after 55.67 seconds<sup>1,670f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Bearkini]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bearkini is the only real threat here as the other enemies are quite weak. However, it has low overall stats here, and despite its high attack rate, it can be easily stalled and defeated with meatshields and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]].

